"``\"path/to/model.onnx\"`` - HTTP/HTTPS URL: "
"``\"https://example.com/model.onnx\"`` - GitHub release: "
"``\"github://owner/repo/tag/file.onnx\"`` - Google Drive: "
"``\"gdrive:FILE_ID\"`` - Preset name: ``\"trba_lite_g1\"`` or "
"``\"trba_base_g1\"`` (from pretrained_registry) - ``None``: auto-downloads "
"default preset (trba_lite_g1)"
